{"id": "47715", "title": "无性婚姻", "author": "卞庆奎", "category": "文学名著", "count": 61, "available": 10, "cover": "files/article/image/47/47715/47715s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/47/47715.htm", "intro": "中国现代都市十对夫妻口述实录。婚姻是社会的基础。婚姻的不和谐，势必会导致社会的不安定。带着“无性婚姻”的诸多疑问，笔者进行了长达一年的深入采访。在采访中我发现，造成无性婚姻的现状虽有多方面因素，但有一点是共同的，尽管不少受访者的婚姻是无性的，无爱的，甚至早已死亡，但是在孩子、房子、票子、面子等一系列现实问题面前，绝大多数夫妻宁可忍受这份残缺，这份死亡，而不去选择中国式离婚。这是一种无奈，更是一种悲哀。", "base": "files/article/html/47/47715", "chapters": [{"title": "花心丈夫践踏了我们的性爱之花", "volume": true}, {"title": "第一节", "file": "6454921.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二节", "file": "6454924.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第三节", "file": "6454925.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第四节", "file": "6454926.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第五节", "file": "6454927.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第六节", "file": "6454928.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第七节", "file": "6454929.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第八节", "file": "6454930.html", "available": false}, {"title": "争吵无休我们的爱在分居中死亡", "volume": true}, {"title": "第一节", "file": "6454932.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二节", "file": "6454933.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第三节", "file": "6454934.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第四节", "file": "6454935.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第五节", "file": "6454936.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第六节", "file": "6454937.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第七节", "file": "6454940.html", "available": false}, {"title": "打拼生活美好的性爱在奔波中消逝", "volume": true}, {"title": "第一节", "file": "6454945.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二节", "file": "6454946.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第三节", "file": "6454947.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第四节", "file": "6454948.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第五节", "file": "6454949.html", "available": false}, {"title": "因为避孕和谐的性爱让安全套套牢", "volume": true}, {"title": "第一节", "file": "6454951.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二节", "file": "6454952.h